ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nToday is the weekend, Xiao Fang tries to convince Li's mother to let her study at a friend's house. Xiao Fang feels that studying at a friend's house allows her to relax more and they can help each other. Li's mother worries that Xiao Fang gets distracted at her friend's house and cannot focus on studying.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiao Fang convince Li's mother?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. She provides her friend's report card or a teacher's recommendation letter as proof.\nB. She lets Li's mother go to her friend's house personally to supervise their study.\nC. She makes a detailed study timetable, showing her plan and organizational skills to Li's mother.\nD. She provides professional surveys or academic reports, detailing the benefits of studying at a friend's house.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0015011461674276408,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e05dd6006945d27fba79","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367581697,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1d2e5de76397474890cbe587d865803c"}